DATA = 'Current charge|Q=cur*t|Q,cur,t|ss0|Constant or average current.|P:1,-cur*t;P:-t,Q;P:-cur,Q\nOhm law|V=cur*res|V,cur,res|ss+|Ohmic resistor; V is voltage drop.|P:1,-cur*res;P:-res,V;P:-cur,V\nResistance geometry|res=rhoe*l/A|res,rhoe,l,A|++++|Uniform cross-section and resistivity.|P:A,-l*rhoe;P:-l,A*res;P:-rhoe,A*res;P:res,-l*rhoe\nDrift current|cur=n*qe*A*vd|cur,n,A,vd|s++0|Current magnitude; qe is elementary magnitude.|P:1,-A*n*qe*vd;P:-A*qe*vd,cur;P:-n*qe*vd,cur;P:-A*n*qe,cur\nCurrent density|cur=jcur*A|cur,jcur,A|ss+|Uniform current density normal to cross-section.|P:1,-A*jcur;P:-A,cur;P:-jcur,cur\nResistors series 2|res=res1+res2|res,res1,res2|+++|Same current.|P:1,-res1 - res2;P:-1,res - res2;P:-1,res - res1\nResistors parallel 2|1/res=1/res1+1/res2|res,res1,res2|+++|Same voltage.|P:-res1 - res2,res1*res2;P:-res + res2,-res*res2;P:-res + res1,-res*res1\nElectrical power IV|P=cur*V|P,cur,V|sss|Passive sign convention.|P:1,-V*cur;P:-V,P;P:-cur,P\nElectrical power IR|P=cur^2*res|P,cur,res|ss+|Resistor dissipated power.|P:1,-cur^2*res;P:-res,0,P;P:-cur^2,P\nElectrical power VR|P=V^2/res|P,V,res|ss+|Resistor dissipated power.|P:res,-V^2;P:-1,0,P*res;P:P,-V^2\nBattery terminal V|V=emf-cur*ri|V,emf,cur,ri|sss+|Discharging positive current; internal ri>0.|P:1,cur*ri - emf;P:-1,V + cur*ri;P:ri,V - emf;P:cur,V - emf\nRC time constant|tau=res*C|tau,res,C|0++|Equivalent R seen by capacitor.|P:1,-C*res;P:-C,tau;P:-res,tau\nRC voltage charging|V=Vb*(1-exp(-t/(res*C)))|V,Vb,t,res,C|ss0++|Initially uncharged; constant ideal source.|P:exp(t/(C*res)),-Vb*exp(t/(C*res)) + Vb;P:1 - exp(t/(C*res)),V*exp(t/(C*res));E:C*res*ln(-Vb/(V - Vb));E:t/(C*ln(-Vb/(V - Vb)));E:t/(res*ln(-Vb/(V - Vb)))\nRC voltage discharge|V=V0*exp(-t/(res*C))|V,V0,t,res,C|ss0++|Source-free discharge; t>=0.|P:exp(t/(C*res)),-V0;P:-1,V*exp(t/(C*res));E:C*res*ln(V0/V);E:t/(C*ln(V0/V));E:t/(res*ln(V0/V))\nRC current charging|cur=Vb/res*exp(-t/(res*C))|cur,Vb,res,t,C|ss+0+|Initially uncharged; resistor current.|P:res*exp(t/(C*res)),-Vb;P:-1,cur*res*exp(t/(C*res));E:;E:C*res*ln(Vb/(cur*res));E:t/(res*ln(Vb/(cur*res)))'
